  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "おはよう、めぐる\r\n今日はいいニュースがあるぞ",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1003001030020,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "えっ、いいニュース！？\r\nなになに？",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100300103/1003001030020"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ぜひめぐるを呼んでほしいって、\r\nまた新しいオファーが入ったんだ",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1003001030030,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "ほんと？　やったー！\r\n最近、いろんなお仕事ができて楽しいなー！",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100300103/1003001030030"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "この間のバックダンサーの仕事で\r\nめぐるの評判がかなり広まったみたいだぞ",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "いい機会だ、そろそろアイドルとしての\r\n方向性を決めていこうか",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1003001030040,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "方向性かぁ……\r\nどうやって決めるの？",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100300103/1003001030040"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そうだな、まずは、めぐるがやりたい仕事を選ぶといい",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1003001030050,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "え？\r\nそれって、わたしが自由に決めてもいいの？",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100300103/1003001030050"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "もちろんだ\r\nめぐる自身がやる仕事なんだから",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1003001030060,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "そっか！　えぇっと、それじゃあねぇ……",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100300103/1003001030060"
  },
  {
    "id": 1003001030070,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "ミニライブでしょ、ダンスでしょ！\r\nあとは握手会とか一日署長とか！　それと他には……",
    "charAnim1": "shy1",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100300103/1003001030070"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "待て待て！",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1003001030080,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "え、どうしたの？",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100300103/1003001030080"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そんなにあったら方向性が決まらないだろ\r\nせめてもう少し絞れないか？",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1003001030090,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "絞る、か……\r\nそうだなぁ、ダンスは大好きだからやりたいし……",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100300103/1003001030090"
  },
  {
    "id": 1003001030100,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "握手会も一日署長もアイドルっぽいから\r\nどっちもやってみたいし……",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100300103/1003001030100"
  },
  {
    "id": 1003001030110,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "うぅ……ごめんプロデューサー……！\r\nワクワクする仕事が多すぎて選べないよぉ……",
    "charAnim1": "sad1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100300103/1003001030110"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "でも時間にも限りがあるからな……\r\nさすがに全部は選べないぞ",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1003001030120,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "んんー……そうだよねぇ……",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100300103/1003001030120"
  },
  {
    "id": 1003001030130,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "ねえ、プロデューサーは\r\nわたしに向いてるお仕事ってなんだと思う？",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100300103/1003001030130"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "うーん。めぐるに向いてる仕事は……",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "l",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "select": "ダンスだな",
    "nextLabel": "1"
  },
  {
    "select": "モデルはどうだ？",
    "nextLabel": "2"
  },
  {
    "textCtrl": "cm",
    "select": "あえて、インテリで",
    "nextLabel": "3"
  },
  {
    "label": "1",
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "やっぱり得意なものを伸ばすのが一番いいだろう",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1003001030140,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "得意なものかぁ……なるほどー！",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100300103/1003001030140"
  },
  {
    "id": 1003001030150,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "わたしも、自分が一番向いてるのは\r\nダンスかなって思うんだ！　ほら！",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100300103/1003001030150"
  },
  {
    "charLabel": "meguru",
