  {
    "id": 1003001030160,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "ね？　ね？　どうかなっ！",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100300103/1003001030160"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "うん、やっぱりめぐるのダンスには華がある",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1003001030170,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "えへへ！　プロデューサーや２８３のみんなの\r\n役に立てるように、これからもっともっと頑張るよ！",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100300103/1003001030170"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "（みんなのため、か……\r\n俺ももっといい仕事を取ってこなくちゃな……！）",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002",
    "nextLabel": "end"
  },
  {
    "id": 1003001030180,
    "label": "2",
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "モデル？\r\nわたしが？",
    "charAnim1": "wait",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100300103/1003001030180"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ああ。めぐるの身のこなしはモデル向きだと思うしな",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1003001030190,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "……えぇと、モデルのポーズってたしかこんな……",
    "charAnim1": "shy1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100300103/1003001030190"
  },
  {
    "id": 1003001030200,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "どうどう？　モデルっぽい？",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100300103/1003001030200"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……えーと。その格好は……？",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1003001030210,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "モデルのポーズだよ！",
    "charAnim3": "yes",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100300103/1003001030210"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……もうちょっとカッコいいポーズとか\r\nないのか？",
    "charAnim3": "blank",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1003001030220,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "あれ？　今のじゃカッコよくない？\r\n……うーん、どんなポーズならいいんだっけ……？",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100300103/1003001030220"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "（ただ、今の微妙なポーズでも、\r\nめぐるなら絵になるんだよな……）",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……やっぱり、めぐるにはモデルの才能があるよ\r\n間違いない",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1003001030230,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "そ、そうかな？　……えへへ\r\nプロデューサーはよく見ててくれるよね！",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100300103/1003001030230"
  },
  {
    "id": 1003001030240,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "こういうポーズを考えるのも楽しいし、\r\nモデルの仕事をやってみるのもいいかなー！",
    "charAnim1": "anger1",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "nextLabel": "end",
    "voice": "produce_events/100300103/1003001030240"
  },
  {
    "label": "3",
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "賢いアイドルを目指してみるのもアリなんじゃないか？",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1003001030250,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "えぇー！　でもわたし、勉強あんまり得意じゃないけど\r\n大丈夫かなぁ……？",
    "charAnim1": "sad1",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100300103/1003001030250"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "苦手なことにチャレンジしてみるってのも\r\nいい経験だよ",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1003001030260,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "そっか、チャレンジかー……たしかに\r\nクイズ番組で難しい問題に答えられたら格好いいかも！",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100300103/1003001030260"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "よし！\r\nそれじゃあ、これからクイズの特訓をやってみるか！",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1003001030270,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "うん、任せて！",
    "charAnim3": "yes",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
